    {
      "kind": "title",
      "source_text": "自分らしく、自分たちらしく",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "none",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": ""
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_a:step-3:text",
        "step_id": 3,
        "step_index": 2,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 29,
          "target_step_index": 2
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "おはようございますー。……あっ、すみません。\n打ち合わせ中でしたかー。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "北村 想楽"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_a:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 29,
          "target_step_index": 6
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "おはようございます、想楽さん。\nそれに、Legendersの皆さんもお揃いで。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_a:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 29,
          "target_step_index": 7
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "●●●●プロデューサーさん、おはようございます。\n……おや？　そちらの方は。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "古論 クリス"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_a:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 29,
          "target_step_index": 8
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "こちら、Wの動画制作に協力してくださった\nディレクターさんです。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_a:step-11:text",
        "step_id": 11,
        "step_index": 10,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 29,
          "target_step_index": 10
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ああ、この間の『24時間リフティング』か。\nずいぶん評判だって聞いたぜ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "葛之葉 雨彦"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_a:step-13:text",
        "step_id": 13,
        "step_index": 12,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 29,
          "target_step_index": 12
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ええ。それでディレクターさんも交えて、\n次回の動画企画を練っていたところです。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_a:step-14:text",
        "step_id": 14,
        "step_index": 13,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 29,
          "target_step_index": 13
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "この勢いに乗って、\n俺たちのことをガンガン宣伝したいからさ、",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "蒼井 享介"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_a:step-16:text",
        "step_id": 16,
        "step_index": 15,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 29,
          "target_step_index": 15
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "みんなでアイデアを持ち寄って、\n盛り上がってたんだ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "蒼井 悠介"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_a:step-17:text",
        "step_id": 17,
        "step_index": 16,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 29,
          "target_step_index": 16
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "漫画の必殺技シュートを真似するとか、\nファンのみんなにサッカーをコーチしに行くとか♪",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "蒼井 悠介"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_a:step-18:text",
        "step_id": 18,
        "step_index": 17,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 29,
          "target_step_index": 17
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "どれも面白そうですね！　……おっと、\nWのお2人は、そろそろ次の予定のお時間ですね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_a:step-19:text",
        "step_id": 19,
        "step_index": 18,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 29,
          "target_step_index": 18
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "OK！　●●●●●●●●●●監督、あとはよろしく。\n悠介、続きは移動しながら考えようぜ♪",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "蒼井 享介"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_a:step-21:text",
        "step_id": 21,
        "step_index": 20,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 29,
          "target_step_index": 20
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "交わされる、言葉に見える、旺盛さ。\n2人とも、やる気十分だねー。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "北村 想楽"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_a:step-25:text",
        "step_id": 25,
        "step_index": 24,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 29,
          "target_step_index": 24
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "はい。おかげで315チャンネルの視聴者も\nずいぶんと増えてきました。ですが……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_a:step-26:text",
        "step_id": 26,
        "step_index": 25,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_04_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 29,
          "target_step_index": 25
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "JIF出演には、まだまだ認知度が必要です。\n例えば、話題のテレビ番組に出演したり……",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_04_a:step-27:text",
        "step_id": 27,
        "step_index": 26,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_04_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
